<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@/~part_I__cl_4__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "For the purposes of this Act, any reference in relation to Malaysia shall include the exclusive economic zone and continental shelf of Malaysia, as defined under the Exclusive Economic Zone Act 1984 [Act 311] and the Continental Shelf Act 1966 [Act 83], as the case may be. Prudent carbon capture, utilization and storage practices"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@> .
