<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@/~part_VII__cl_33__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@/~part_VII__cl_33__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "No person shall carry out any onshore geological assessment of any potential storage complex or geological formation in onshore areas without an onshore assessment permit granted by the Agency."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@> .
