<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@/~part_VII__cl_33__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@/~part_VII__cl_33> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@> .
