<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@/~part_VII__cl_35__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "No person shall carry out the operation of a storage site in the onshore areas of Malaysia for the permanent storage of carbon dioxide captured within or outside of Malaysia without an onshore storage licence issued by the Agency."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@/~part_VII__cl_35__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@/~part_VII__cl_35> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@> .
