<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@/~part_VII__cl_35__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "An application for an onshore storage licence under subsection (1) shall be made to the Agency in such manner and accompanied by such fees as may be prescribed."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@/~part_VII__cl_35__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@/~part_VII__cl_35> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@> .
