<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@/~part_VII__cl_35__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "An application for an onshore storage licence under this section may be withdrawn at any time before the onshore storage licence is granted or refused."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@/~part_VII__cl_35__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@/~part_VII__cl_35> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@> .
