<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@/~part_VII__cl_35__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The Agency may at any time after the receipt of an application under subsection (2) and before the application is determined, by a written notice, require the applicant to provide any additional documents or information within the period specified."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@> .
