<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@/~part_VII__cl_37__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "No onshore operator shall accept and inject carbon dioxide streams into a storage site in onshore areas unless such carbon dioxide streams comply with the carbon dioxide stream acceptance criteria specified in section 28."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@/~part_VII__cl_37__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@/~part_VII__cl_37> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@> .
