<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@/~part_VII__cl_37__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "An onshore operator shall keep a register of the quantities and properties of the carbon dioxide streams accepted and injected, including the composition of the stream."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@/~part_VII__cl_37__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@/~part_VII__cl_37> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@> .
