<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@/~part_VII__cl_38> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@/~part_VII__cl_38> <https://schema.org/text> "The operational obligations in relation to offshore storage specified in section 29 shall apply mutatis mutandis to the operational obligations to be imposed on an onshore operator in the case of onshore storage. Closure and post-closure obligations in relation to onshore storage"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@/~part_VII> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "39" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@> .
