<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39> <https://schema.org/text> "The closure and post-closure obligations in relation to offshore storage specified in section 31 shall apply mutatis mutandis to the closure and post-closure obligations to be imposed on an onshore operator in the case of onshore storage. Transfer of obligations in relation to onshore storage"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@/~part_VII__cl_40> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@/~part_VII> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@> .
