<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@/~part_VII__cl_40> <https://schema.org/text> "Prior to a closure of a storage site pursuant in an onshore area to section 39, any transfer of obligations relating to monitoring, corrective measures and remediation measures of the storage site in an onshore area shall be determined by the Minister, after consultation with the State Government, as the case may be."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@> .
