<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@/~part_X__cl_47__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Minister may, after considering the appeal made under subsection (1), confirm or set aside the decision appealed against. Prosecution"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@> .
