<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@/~part_X__cl_50__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Where any person who commits an offence under this Act or any regulations made under this Act is a body corporate, a person who at the time of the commission of the offence was a director, compliance officer, partner, manager, secretary or other similar officer of the body corporate or was purporting to act in the capacity or was in any manner or to any extent responsible for the management of any of the affairs of the body corporate or was assisting in its management—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/10/eng@> .
